WEBVTT

00:07:28.295 --> 00:07:31.941
And I think, even though 
a lot of the universities, including ours,

00:07:31.941 --> 00:07:38.101
went immediately into a seamless -
at least we have been lucky,

00:07:38.101 --> 00:07:42.653
I think the Foundation and HBKU 
managed to go in a seamless way

00:07:42.653 --> 00:07:44.573
into online education.

00:07:44.573 --> 00:07:48.003
But we have all discovered 
that online education

00:07:48.003 --> 00:07:52.305
providing lectures and slides 
over the Internet,

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:56.165
it is not really the end of the story.

00:07:56.165 --> 00:07:58.809
This is maybe not the best we could do.

00:07:58.809 --> 00:08:00.870
I think what we are thinking